{"actor":{"type":"system"},"content":{"blocks":[{"content":"1\t# Turnbridge\n2\t\n3\tLossless visible-conversation continuity between coding agent CLIs.\n4\t\n5\t[Conversation Ledger](https://github.com/evintunador/conversation-ledger)\n6\tcaptures native local transcripts (Claude Code, Codex) incrementally into git\n7\tnotes. Turnbridge is the resume layer on top: one picker across CLIs, honest\n8\tsession typing, and rehydration of a conversation into a *different* CLI —\n9\twithout claiming to transfer hidden reasoning or provider-private state.\n10\t\n11\t## Usage\n12\t\n13\t```sh\n14\t# capture (once per machine): conversation-ledger hooks\n15\tcledger install all\n16\t\n17\t# pick a conversation from this repo's history and resume it anywhere\n18\tturnbridge resume            # interactive: choose conversation, then target CLI\n19\tturnbridge resume codex      # resume straight into Codex\n20\tturnbridge resume claude     # resume straight into Claude Code\n21\tturnbridge list              # print compatible conversations\n22\t\n23\t# options\n24\t#   --all         include collaborators' conversations\n25\t#   --any-commit  include conversations from other branches/commits\n26\t#   --bootstrap   force transcript rehydration instead of native fabrication\n27\t\n28\t# optional: make bare `claude --resume` / `codex resume` open the merged picker\n29\tturnbridge shim install\n30\t```\n31\t\n32\tSame-CLI selections use the CLI's native resume. Cross-CLI selections write a\n33\ttarget-native session file and hand off to the target's own resume; when that\n34\tis unsupported for the installed CLI version, turnbridge falls back to a fresh\n35\tsession bootstrapped with the literal transcript.\n36\t\n37\tSee [product intent](docs/PRODUCT_INTENT.md) and the [WIP technical design](docs/WIP_TECHNICAL_DESIGN.md).\n38\t\n39\t## Development\n40\t\n41\t```sh\n42\tnpm install   # links ../conversation-ledger\n43\tnpm test      # build + node --test\n44\t```\n45\t\n46\t## License\n47\t\n48\t[MIT](LICENSE)\n49\t","tool_use_id":"toolu_01EgUieJaA42RDwJUxoCve1g","type":"tool_result"}],"role":"user"},"context":{"branch":"main","cwd":"/Users/evintunador/repos/evintunador/turnbridge","dirty_fingerprint":"bc65e878d80c1722a0adee9428cbf850f1d73e21ecfd82d0c4182876ebf93c10","head":"173cfc66bb28f4c20e474f522f197eeef0c627de","repo":"git@github.com:evintunador/turnbridge.git"},"conversation":{"id":"claude-code:6b979ed9-e38e-4fea-b585-342bba5a333c#agent:a320d69d7506c9fa1","parent":"claude-code:6b979ed9-e38e-4fea-b585-342bba5a333c","seq":8},"id":"ev1-578690d0f54e9174101dc5268cb2e6b6d7e82772cce62ada4d57f308c9c30552","kind":"conversation_turn","occurred_at":"2026-07-21T21:21:04.377Z","producer":{"session_id":"6b979ed9-e38e-4fea-b585-342bba5a333c","source":"claude-code","source_version":"2.1.216","tool":"cledger","version":"0.20.0"},"raw":{"data":{"agentId":"a320d69d7506c9fa1","cwd":"/Users/evintunador/repos/evintunador/turnbridge","entrypoint":"cli","gitBranch":"main","isSidechain":true,"message":{"content":[{"content":"1\t# Turnbridge\n2\t\n3\tLossless visible-conversation continuity between coding agent CLIs.\n4\t\n5\t[Conversation Ledger](https://github.com/evintunador/conversation-ledger)\n6\tcaptures native local transcripts (Claude Code, Codex) incrementally into git\n7\tnotes. Turnbridge is the resume layer on top: one picker across CLIs, honest\n8\tsession typing, and rehydration of a conversation into a *different* CLI —\n9\twithout claiming to transfer hidden reasoning or provider-private state.\n10\t\n11\t## Usage\n12\t\n13\t```sh\n14\t# capture (once per machine): conversation-ledger hooks\n15\tcledger install all\n16\t\n17\t# pick a conversation from this repo's history and resume it anywhere\n18\tturnbridge resume            # interactive: choose conversation, then target CLI\n19\tturnbridge resume codex      # resume straight into Codex\n20\tturnbridge resume claude     # resume straight into Claude Code\n21\tturnbridge list              # pr