onversations; `--all` shows every\n98\tauthor with labels. Transport is optional-but-default-on: Conversation\n99\tLedger's auto-installed pre-push hook and fetch refspec ride normal\n100\t`git push`/`git fetch`, gated by the ledger's secret scan and disableable per\n101\tuser (`{\"transport\": {\"hook\": false, \"fetchRefspec\": false}}`); `cledger sync`\n102\tremains available for an explicit push/fetch/merge. Turnbridge adds no\n103\tnetwork behavior of its own — it only reads whatever the ledger has already\n104\tabsorbed locally. Events captured before identity stamping existed are\n105\tunattributed; a forced transcript rescan after the upgrade can duplicate\n106\tthose turns under new event ids.\n107\t\n108\t## Risks\n109\t\n110\tNative formats change without notice (fabrication is version-pinned, bootstrap\n111\tis the recovery path); transcript content can include secrets (the ledger\n112\tredacts at capture and sync time, but matching is pattern/entropy-based and\n113\tcannot catch every secret — review before sharing still matters); full\n114\thistories can exceed the target's context (size is reported before launch);\n115\tcrashes mid-turn leave partial capture, which the ledger tolerates by design.\n116\t","tool_use_id":"toolu_01SKbQoX8wUStXkxTeWohQRK","type":"tool_result"}],"role":"user"},"context":{"branch":"main","cwd":"/Users/evintunador/repos/evintunador/turnbridge","dirty_fingerprint":"bc65e878d80c1722a0adee9428cbf850f1d73e21ecfd82d0c4182876ebf93c10","head":"173cfc66bb28f4c20e474f522f197eeef0c627de","repo":"git@github.com:evintunador/turnbridge.git"},"conversation":{"id":"claude-code:6b979ed9-e38e-4fea-b585-342bba5a333c#agent:a00a6de33281486a4","parent":"claude-code:6b979ed9-e38e-4fea-b585-342bba5a333c","seq":40},"id":"ev1-6daa4a82101284be6bb45693954105aa95490cdb4e615d091d26c1dee5352d4d","kind":"conversation_turn","occurred_at":"2026-07-21T22:10:25.714Z","producer":{"session_id":"6b979ed9-e38e-4fea-b585-342bba5a333c","source":"claude-code","source