{"actor":{"type":"system"},"content":{"blocks":[{"content":"commit c36b4b5569af37157237f4f433be6e5f8554d5e6\nAuthor: Evin Tunador <evintunador@gmail.com>\nDate:   Mon Jul 20 23:31:51 2026 -0700\n\n    Detect off-machine rewrites: patch-id/tree matching, auto-applied on read\n    \n    detectRewrites compares each local branch no longer reachable from the\n    remote default branch against the target's new first-parent commits:\n    tree equality catches a squash of an unmoved target, patch-id over\n    zero-context diffs catches squashes past unrelated drift and per-commit\n    rebase/bot rewrites. Only exact matches are proposed; two candidates\n    with the same fingerprint are reported as ambiguous, never guessed.\n    Branches with no noted commits are skipped. readEvents now runs the\n    pass lazily after absorbIncoming (default on, {\"reanchor\":{\"auto\":\n    false}} opts out), gated on a target-tip cursor and never throwing.\n    \n    Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\ndiff --git a/src/index.ts b/src/index.ts\nindex 04709f5..5257cc6 100644\n--- a/src/index.ts\n+++ b/src/index.ts\n@@ -9,8 +9,9 @@ export {\n   listAnchors,\n   readNoteEvents,\n   captureContext,\n+  runReAnchor,\n } from \"./store.js\";\n-export type { AppendResult, ReadOptions, TransportPushResult } from \"./store.js\";\n+export type { AppendResult, ReadOptions, ReAnchorRunResult, TransportPushResult } from \"./store.js\";\n export { absorbIncoming, ensureTransport, INCOMING_REF, NOTES_NAME, NOTES_REF } from \"./transport.js\";\n export type { TransportSetup } from \"./transport.js\";\n export type { CaptureResult } from \"./adapters/drift.js\";\n@@ -36,5 +37,10 @@ export { captureClaudeTranscript, runClaudeCodeHook } from \"./adapters/claude-co\n export { captureCodexTranscript, runCodexHook } from \"./adapters/codex.js\";\n export { renormalize } from \"./renormalize.js\";\n export type { RenormalizeResult } from \"./renormalize.js\";\n-export { parseReAnchor, reAn